;; What kin needs to know about this project: which vocabularies to load, and
;; where each target puts a namespace's generated code.
;;
;; `:targets` names a NAMESPACE rather than listing descriptors, because a
;; target now carries `:path` -- a function from namespace to file -- and a
;; function cannot be written in EDN. Everything else kin discovers from the
;; sources themselves.
{:vocabularies [flint.impl.rt flint.impl.hash]
 :targets flint.impl.targets}
